From bc01a105466522dae2a3dfd7ca4433a228bb630e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:03:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: mirror the owner's settings and wallpaper to the
 decoy at the lock

Squash of former patches:

- 0018 oblivios: copy the owner's display and lock-screen settings to the Duress decoy at the switch
- 0019 oblivios: mirror the decoy settings when the device locks and never copy custom tiles
- 0020 oblivios: copy only plain built-in tile names to the decoy
- 0021 oblivios: SPIKE start the decoy launcher process while the decoy is locked
- 0022 oblivios: copy the owner's night mode to the decoy so the switch does not change the display configuration
- 0023 oblivios: bind the KeyChain of a cold user off the shared SystemUI background thread
- 0024 oblivios: mirror volumes, refresh rate, theme and lock screen values the decoy lacked
- 0025 oblivios: copy the owner's wallpaper to the decoy at the lock, off the credential path
